    "name": "Effect: Depth 4 for This Strike",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>A critical hit.</strong> The Substrates named here count as <strong>Depth 4 for this Strike</strong> — its damage and whatever answers it landing — whether or not they are at Depth 4. Gold's Instinct, Topaz at Depth 4 and <em>Apex Predator</em> make it. It ends when your next attack is rolled, or at the end of your turn. Not while the Carapace is broken, which switches every Mutation at Depth 3 or higher off.</p>"
